WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.534
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.484 --> 00:00:03.427
A mountain of lemons!

3
00:00:03.427 --> 00:00:05.617
Maya can't squeeze them all!

4
00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.879
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:08.879 --> 00:00:11.304
This is Episode 61.

6
00:00:11.304 --> 00:00:13.283
Meet the night basket.

7
00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:15.744
Maya puts the lemons inside.

8
00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:17.616
They wait in a line.

9
00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:19.229
Night comes.

10
00:00:19.229 --> 00:00:21.125
Maya goes to sleep.

11
00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:23.316
The moon on the lid glows.

12
00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:25.647
Out hop the little squeezers.

13
00:00:25.647 --> 00:00:27.920
One, two, ten!

14
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.687
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

15
00:00:30.687 --> 00:00:33.760
The big job gets done, lemon by lemon.

16
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.421
The last lemon?

17
00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:36.669
Done!

18
00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.918
The squeezers hop back in.

19
00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:41.238
Nobody stays up for nothing.

20
00:00:41.238 --> 00:00:42.604
Morning.

21
00:00:42.604 --> 00:00:44.394
Pitchers everywhere!

22
00:00:44.394 --> 00:00:46.855
Maya did not squeeze one lemon.

23
00:00:46.855 --> 00:00:49.445
Big jobs, done while you sleep.

24
00:00:49.445 --> 00:00:51.553
That is the night basket.

25
00:00:51.553 --> 00:00:54.120
Now you know AWS Batch!

26
00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

